Source: lead
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), cargo, rustc, clang, libclang-dev, git
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/planetscale/lead

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-lead
Architecture: any
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: TIN-compatible text search for development and testing on PostgreSQL PGVERSION
 Lead provides the tin access method, TINQL matching, tokenization, scoring,
 and highlighting for development, tests, and CI. It intentionally scans
 the heap for exact matches and is unsuitable for production workloads.
 The SQL extension is named tin and loads without shared preload libraries.
 This package contains an untagged upstream source snapshot.
